# Input

```css
#notifications-toolbar {
	&:has(> #tab-notification-deck-template, > #tab-notification-deck:where([selected-view=""], :not([selected-view])), > #tab-notification-deck > [slot="selected"]:empty) {
		display: none;
	}

	.toolbar-item:not(.aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa, .bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb) {
		color: red;
	}

	> .toolbar-item:is(.aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa, .bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb) {
		color: red;
	}
}

```


# Formatted

```css
#notifications-toolbar {
	&:has(
		> #tab-notification-deck-template,
		> #tab-notification-deck:where([selected-view=""], :not([selected-view])),
		> #tab-notification-deck > [slot="selected"]:empty
	) {
		display: none;
	}

	.toolbar-item:not(
		.aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa,
		.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
	) {
		color: red;
	}

	> .toolbar-item:is(
			.aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa,
			.bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
		) {
		color: red;
	}
}

```
